Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.35,Title,,0,0,0,,Dispute au café
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:04.20,Char,,0,0,0,,LÉA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:04.20,Line,,0,0,0,,Max, tu as encore oublié le portefeuille ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:07.80,Char,,0,0,0,,MAX
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:07.80,Line,,0,0,0,,Non, non, je l’ai… quelque part.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:11.40,Char,,0,0,0,,LÉA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:11.40,Line,,0,0,0,,Quelque part ? On est au café, Max !
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:15.40,Char,,0,0,0,,MAX
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:15.40,Line,,0,0,0,,Bon, tu paies, et je t’invite la prochaine fois.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:18.60,Char,,0,0,0,,LÉA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:18.60,Line,,0,0,0,,C’est ce que tu as dit la dernière fois.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:21.80,Char,,0,0,0,,MAX
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:21.80,Line,,0,0,0,,Cette fois, c’est vrai. Promis.
